<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00434">
	<title>Performance Timer (For GT)</title>
	<shortdesc>Performance timer measures the time it takes to reach a specific speed range and displays the performance time.</shortdesc>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>performance timer</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<section id="e03231">
			<title>Performance Timer settings</title>
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03232">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e03233">
									<image href="../../../images/OOV045033.eps" align="center" placement="break" scale="95" id="e03234"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<ul id="e03235">
				<li>
					<p>Tap <uicontrol>Performance Timer</uicontrol> menu, and tap <uicontrol>Start</uicontrol> from the infotainment screen.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Engage the accelerator pedal to start the measurement.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
		<section id="e03236">
			<title>Operating conditions</title>
			<ul id="e03237">
				<li>
					<p>Vehicle speed reaches approximately 100 km/h (62 mph)</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>When passing 200 m (656 ft)</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>When passing 400 m (1,312 ft)</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
			<note type="tip" id="e03238">
				<ul id="e03239">
					<li>
						<p>Press <uicontrol>Reset</uicontrol> to clear the performance timer.</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>Press <uicontrol>Reset History</uicontrol> to clear all the timer records shown on the right side.</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>You can also control the performance timer on the instrument cluster using the steering wheel button.</p>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</note>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>